  "section": "6.51",
  "rulesText": "Ability: Dexterity\n\nWeight: 5 lb.\n\nUtilize: Carve a pattern in wood (DC 10)\n\nCraft: Club, Greatclub, Quarterstaff, Ranged weapons (except Pistol, Musket, and Sling), Arcane Focus, Arrows, Bolts, Druidic Focus, Ink Pen, Needles"
